Update the admin assets build: node 21 to node 26, and the webpack loaders, plugins and `datatables.net-plugins` to current releases. `sass` is no longer held below 1.33; admin-lte stays below 3.2.0, whose SCSS includes a mixin that uses the parent selector at the top level and which no sass version compiles. The sass deprecations that admin-lte and its bundled bootstrap raise are silenced by id in `webpack.config.js`, since nothing in this repository can address them.
